OL,3,GNEWSAGarvaghy Road parade will not be
OL,4,Apoliced 'at any cost' - PSNI chief
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's top police officer
OL,7,Fhas said the force's "principle
OL,8,Fobjective" is to police the decision to
OL,9,Fallow a parade down the Garvaghy Road
OL,10,Fin Portadown, but added this would not
OL,11,Fbe done "at any cost".
OL,13,FPolice Service of Northern Ireland
OL,14,F(PSNI) Chief Constable Jon Boutcher
OL,15,Fsaid his overriding responsibility is
OL,16,Fto keep people safe.
OL,18,FHe has also offered to meet both sides
OL,19,Fin the stalemate, the Orange Order and
OL,20,Fthe Garvaghy Road Residents' Coalition.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
